  "review": {
    "ownership": "完整实读state原schema/factory/转换＋新10成员slot、整个authority和new4cases。stateSlot只持原noble/body引用和唯一两个#JSON；authority保owners唯一WeakMap/所有原体生命、contracttarget/夜间/paid知识，没有第二份可变库存。",
    "identity": "canonical先own原槽refs，再normalized reader JSON内容比较并贵族优先短路；readers始终副本，没有加入Mist式逐数组/行身份lease。proto/null/data读取与writeState普通proto/writable/configurable规则各维持原差异。",
    "prefix": "7实际writer完整保next求值点；同原对象先整descriptor校验再按Reflect.ownKeys逐字段defineProperty；writeState完整248节点。JSON getter lookup在所有字段写后，编码失败旧shadow保，下一lease/knowledge/targetmarker不前移，失败checkpoint分开decode旧shadow。",
    "constructor": "原owners.set callee→object args位置仍在；两个原raw refs先捕获，normalized nobleData先编码/bodyData后编码，再Map和knowledge。新class allocation/methoddispatch/private布局差异有意明确，不claim任意私有monkeypatch兼容。",
    "privacy": "知识只来自原已告知projection；slotcodec仅local audit，不偷代Tape schema/recordverifier或把raw库存给玩家。World/life/phase/request与死亡真实写权不归slot。",
    "proof": "已实际读完整proof.cjs：getChildren全child显式loop；find回调void。完整算法actual新writer/commit/compare/decoder/constructor再逐接口展开7calls，entireAuthority8980/state3806/4mappedoutputs，而不是恢复旧wholebody。newtesttypeonly2emit和末3comment6emit仅作者原收据，不重验证。",
    "comments": "末正式名称夜之贵族/觉醒愚者秘密之身准确；NightChoice知识与damage/payment区别、BodyResource夜伤/免放逐终态、ServantContract一次终态/仅提案而不标死说明与actual select/end/resolve/consume body一致。没有新增许可或假schema承诺。"
